{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to carve your legend in the Jianghu!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/17e8a0959b2a7da004ee6e8b21c048b2.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/17e8a0959b2a7da004ee6e8b21c048b2.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/f565c269380e4720302674e480b1dd51.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/f565c269380e4720302674e480b1dd51.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/f565c269380e4720302674e480b1dd51.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No static slashing here! Experience <strong>bone-crunching combat</strong> with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face-to-face melee exchanges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-second offense/defense transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal counterattacks exploiting enemy vulnerabilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/2808d86df7c337ad83b5d983c8e378c6.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/2808d86df7c337ad83b5d983c8e378c6.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/f2eb0705e13a031f1458feb33f2844dd.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/f2eb0705e13a031f1458feb33f2844dd.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/f2eb0705e13a031f1458feb33f2844dd.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sect boasts a <strong>showstopping ultimate ability</strong>\u2014unleash dazzling animations to decisively end battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/076585ed61b626319bc8cf996bdd1469.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/076585ed61b626319bc8cf996bdd1469.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b8c68e5b16b4b90aa81849048ad5642c.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b8c68e5b16b4b90aa81849048ad5642c.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b8c68e5b16b4b90aa81849048ad5642c.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited funds per round</strong>: Carefully curate purchases from shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load capacity system</strong>: Optimize equipment and relics within weight limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four-Manual Synergy</strong>: Equip four manuals to unlock world-shattering combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b4103a19423d4d36a301fc1bdd594279.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/b4103a19423d4d36a301fc1bdd594279.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/afe597f16201b6bd6add10741606e78e.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/afe597f16201b6bd6add10741606e78e.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/afe597f16201b6bd6add10741606e78e.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All martial sects share one unified Fate System (randomized skills). Players primarily obtain additional Fate Cards by forging relics. Before each battle, roll multiple 6-sided dice and use the results to activate Fate Cards, unleashing their effects in the upcoming combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/3bf7a2cc8aee620b24dc45a02bdf2793.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/3bf7a2cc8aee620b24dc45a02bdf2793.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8923d06826711ab842c67563465909a1.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8923d06826711ab842c67563465909a1.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8923d06826711ab842c67563465909a1.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Fate and Relics can trigger the Wuxing elemental attacks, each with unique status effects. By combining them with key Fate, you can unleash devastating chain reactions for massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/551b4bd47ddc773d8db135533aeecd24.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/551b4bd47ddc773d8db135533aeecd24.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8e30167e4c5ef3d9f504814150f639be.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8e30167e4c5ef3d9f504814150f639be.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8e30167e4c5ef3d9f504814150f639be.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every relic is a crafting ingredient. Visit the blacksmith to fuse relics into legendary weapons\u2014<strong>inheriting base stats</strong> while gaining <strong>new unique skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/575fd64bc4baf975540cbb98ecc37983.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/575fd64bc4baf975540cbb98ecc37983.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/9371ea4d31bae2d7ba100d35f2f90df5.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/9371ea4d31bae2d7ba100d35f2f90df5.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/9371ea4d31bae2d7ba100d35f2f90df5.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldly Relics:</strong> Over 100 unique relics across four tiers (Common, Rare, Epic, and Legendary). Boost your stats and unlock powerful active item skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial Secret Manuals:</strong> 60 distinct manuals that allow you to either enhance your sect's skills or fundamentally transform them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate Dice:</strong> Over 70 random Fate cards to discover. Each Fate skill opens up entirely new build paths for your character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/280382ad2a62d6bfcb414324d152c1f4.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/280382ad2a62d6bfcb414324d152c1f4.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/202b7c537103a4d71f47eb0d0f1eb145.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/202b7c537103a4d71f47eb0d0f1eb145.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=733 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sect offers distinct skills, manuals, and <strong>fully voiced backstories</strong>. Unlock their tales to explore characters\u2019 heroic deeds and quirky daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to carve your legend in the Jianghu!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: <a href=\"mailto:wystan30@gmail.com\">wystan30@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378130?t=1770618541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378130?t=1770618541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s