a <strong>showstopping ultimate ability</strong>\u2014unleash dazzling animations to decisively end battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/076585ed61b626319bc8cf996bdd1469.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/076585ed61b626319bc8cf996bdd1469.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b8c68e5b16b4b90aa81849048ad5642c.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b8c68e5b16b4b90aa81849048ad5642c.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b8c68e5b16b4b90aa81849048ad5642c.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited funds per round</strong>: Carefully curate purchases from shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load capacity system</strong>: Optimize equipment and relics within weight limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four-Manual Synergy</strong>: Equip four manuals to unlock world-shattering combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/b4103a19423d4d36a301fc1bdd594279.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/b4103a19423d4d36a301fc1bdd594279.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/afe597f16201b6bd6add10741606e78e.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/afe597f16201b6bd6add10741606e78e.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/afe597f16201b6bd6add10741606e78e.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All martial sects share one unified Fate System (randomized skills). Players primarily obtain additional Fate Cards by forging relics. Before each battle, roll multiple 6-sided dice and use the results to activate Fate Cards, unleashing their effects in the upcoming combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/3bf7a2cc8aee620b24dc45a02bdf2793.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/3bf7a2cc8aee620b24dc45a02bdf2793.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8923d06826711ab842c67563465909a1.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8923d06826711ab842c67563465909a1.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8923d06826711ab842c67563465909a1.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Fate and Relics can trigger the Wuxing elemental attacks, each with unique status effects. By combining them with key Fate, you can unleash devastating chain reactions for massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/551b4bd47ddc773d8db135533aeecd24.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/551b4bd47ddc773d8db135533aeecd24.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8e30167e4c5ef3d9f504814150f639be.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8e30167e4c5ef3d9f504814150f639be.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/8e30167e4c5ef3d9f504814150f639be.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every relic is a crafting ingredient. Visit the blacksmith to fuse relics into legendary weapons\u2014<strong>inheriting base stats</strong> while gaining <strong>new unique skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/575fd64bc4baf975540cbb98ecc37983.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/575fd64bc4baf975540cbb98ecc37983.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/9371ea4d31bae2d7ba100d35f2f90df5.poster.avif?t=1770618541\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/9371ea4d31bae2d7ba100d35f2f90df5.webm?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/9371ea4d31bae2d7ba100d35f2f90df5.mp4?t=1770618541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldly Relics:</strong> Over 100 unique relics across four tiers (Common, Rare, Epic, and Legendary). Boost your stats and unlock powerful active item skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial Secret Manuals:</strong> 60 distinct manuals that allow you to either enhance your sect's skills or fundamentally transform them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate Dice:</strong> Over 70 random Fate cards to discover. Each Fate skill opens up entirely new build paths for your character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/280382ad2a62d6bfcb414324d152c1f4.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/280382ad2a62d6bfcb414324d152c1f4.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras/202b7c537103a4d71f47eb0d0f1eb145.avif?t=1770618541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/extras_big/202b7c537103a4d71f47eb0d0f1eb145.webp?t=1770618541 width=1560 height=733 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sect offers distinct skills, manuals, and <strong>fully voiced backstories</strong>. Unlock their tales to explore characters\u2019 heroic deeds and quirky daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to carve your legend in the Jianghu!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: <a href=\"mailto:wystan30@gmail.com\">wystan30@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u55b5\u8a00\u5de5\u574a MiaoYan Workshop"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378130/32011008c3c8932f13a60e3512d41ca226451f40/header.jpg?t=1770618541","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3378130/232542090/9d49c056dffca1b4255866cfd3ac3cd64f6220b4/1770364972/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770607032","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3378130/232542090/9d49c056dffca1b4255866cfd3ac3cd64f6220b4/1770364972/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770607032","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3378130/232542090/9d49c056dffca1b4255866cfd3ac3cd64f6220b4/1770364972/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770607032","id":257280885,"name":"Fighting Rogue Trailer 03","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257280885/443281e86e63ad35d302dc911faf777ad1d8f926/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770607032"}],"name":"Fighting Rogue","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<str